   "textLength": 353,
   "text": "Lachie Neale has been sensationally banned from Saturday’s grand final clash against his old club, with the Brisbane star set to head to the tribunal to dispute the ruling.\nNeale was hit with a one-match ban for an off-the-ball strike on Hawthorn’s Jack Ginnivan late in the first quarter of the preliminary final.\nWATCH THE INCIDENT IN THE PLAYER ABOVE",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
