   "text": "The Lions confirmed within minutes of the charge being finalised that they would head to the tribunal, despite having until Monday morning to decide.\nNeale appears to face a significant challenge in getting the ban overturned. Under the AFL’s latest match review guidelines, intentional strikes to the stomach are graded as medium rather than low impact.",
